# Purpose
Guides that help a new user understand what to do in their first GreatVibe
session.

# Key Files
- `welcome-to-greatvibe.md`
- `first-10-minutes.md`
- `ask-mochi-for-help.md`

# Dependencies
- `../CATALOGUE.md` links these guides into public navigation.
- `../videos/index.json` may reference matching welcome videos.

# Gotchas
- Keep product explanations practical and public-safe.
- Avoid internal platform architecture, private routes, or unreleased promises.

# Change History
- 2026-08-03: Created first-session guide set.
